{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nourish</strong> is a retro-styled 3D horror game about survival, responsibility, and the terrifying cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 15 minute challenging experience, you play as a junior employee of Echium Enterprises, you're tasked with transporting <i>Project V\u00e1yu</i>,\u00a0a mysterious plant discovered on a distant alien world. Early research suggests it could solve Echium\u2019s oxygen shortage aboard deep-space vessels. But in isolation, far from home, you quickly realize the plant is growing... <i>hungry</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time and dwindling resources carefully. Feed the plant. Maintain the ship. Survive.<br>Because if V\u00e1yu dies \u2014 you do too.<br> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.poster.avif?t=1757460497\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.webp?t=1757460497\" class=\"bb_img\" width=188 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703030?t=1757460497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703030?t=1757460497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/bc9990e15a07401291350de0fb5bf07d57276090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757460497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams